1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,740
This message looks secret.

2
00:00:01,740 --> 00:00:03,240
Meet me on Mars.

3
00:00:03,240 --> 00:00:04,800
That is all it says.

4
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:06,190
CyberChef can reveal it

5
00:00:06,190 --> 00:00:06,920
for free,

6
00:00:07,050 --> 00:00:08,270
right in your browser.

7
00:00:08,270 --> 00:00:09,190
Paste the text

8
00:00:09,190 --> 00:00:10,090
into Input.

9
00:00:10,090 --> 00:00:11,880
Add From Base64 to

10
00:00:11,880 --> 00:00:12,650
the recipe.

11
00:00:12,650 --> 00:00:15,160
The readable message appears automatically.

12
00:00:15,160 --> 00:00:16,730
But here is the useful

13
00:00:16,730 --> 00:00:17,520
distinction.

14
00:00:17,520 --> 00:00:19,650
Base64 is encoding,

15
00:00:19,650 --> 00:00:20,580
not encryption.

16
00:00:20,580 --> 00:00:22,220
Anyone can reverse it without

17
00:00:22,220 --> 00:00:22,790
a key.

18
00:00:22,790 --> 00:00:24,130
Use it to inspect data,

19
00:00:24,130 --> 00:00:24,390
never

20
00:00:24,730 --> 00:00:26,120
to hide a password.

21
00:00:26,120 --> 00:00:28,650
Subscribe for more useful software.
